==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q156871}}{{lb|en|anatomy}} An [[endocrine gland]], about the size of a pea, that sits in a small, bony cavity at the base of the [[brain]] whose [[secretion]]s control the other endocrine glands and influence growth, [[metabolism]]{{,}} and [[maturation]].
#: {{syn|en|glandula pituitaria|hypophysis|master gland|pituitary body}}

====Derived terms====
* [[anterior pituitary gland]]
* [[posterior pituitary gland]]

